{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "story_whispr_set_1_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_whispr_set_1",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "雨落之前",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_whispr_1_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "7970f4e0231516edad90b2fcec3034b0de71d8db776248912f6e65da55d5aa63",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_infirmary"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你好，洛拉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛拉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“......高塔隱沒在，水霧之中，淅淅瀝瀝的雨......落在幾千柄傘面上......”"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛拉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，醫生好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "抱歉，打擾了你讀書。感覺怎麼樣？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛拉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......受傷的地方沒有那麼疼了，但還是經常覺得頭暈，看不清東西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "現在靜脈注射的速度，可以適應嗎？有沒有覺得不舒服？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛拉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "手臂有點涼涼的，但是已經習慣啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛拉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "醫生，我還要打幾天針呀？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......這一點要視情況而定。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛拉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "會很久嗎？我好想出去走走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛拉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我感覺自己好像躺在這裡好多天了。明明一動不動，可還是覺得好累。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不會太久的。只是你的傷口還在癒合中，等它長好，你就可以自由活動了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不過......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_ri_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蜜莓",
      "speakerId": "avg_449_glider_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那個被源石炸彈誤傷的孩子，她的血液分析結果也出來了。病情確實還在明顯惡化。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蜜莓",
      "speakerId": "avg_449_glider_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "雖然惡化速度得到了一定控制，但......唉，畢竟是急性感染，還有多處開放性損傷。我們能為她做的應急處理都做了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蜜莓",
      "speakerId": "avg_449_glider_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "從造影結果來看，她體內的源石已經壓迫到了視神經。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，她自己也感覺到異常了。有時候她會視野模糊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們的抑制藥物還沒能讓她的病情穩定下來，以現在的狀況來推斷......她很可能會失明。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是，如果現在再告訴她一個新的壞消息的話，那個孩子能不能承受得住呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果躺在床上的人是我的話，或許會覺得，無論是多麼殘酷的事實，都比一直懸著心卻什麼也不知道要好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是，她還沒有意識到害怕，還沒有開始做她漫長的噩夢，如果能讓她多安心幾天的話......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_infirmary"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛拉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我知道，可以自由活動之後，醫生們也還要觀察一段時間，等我的礦石病病情穩定了，我才可以從羅德島出院。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛拉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不過昨天另一個醫生告訴我，羅德島是一艘很大的船，有醫護人員陪同的話，我也可以離開住院部，去逛逛別的地方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛拉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她還從圖書室帶了本書給我看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是的，羅德島很大......你還可以做很多事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "接下來我要給你換藥了，不用太在意我這裡的工作，請繼續看書就好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛拉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那我可以念出聲嗎？我不想聽到藥瓶和鑷子的聲音，有點嚇人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，當然可以。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛拉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“忘記帶傘的我，看見街道對面的，咖啡廳屋簷下，站著......一個怪人。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛拉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“她......打扮得很......不入時，抱著一把琴，低聲地......對著雨幕唱歌。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛拉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“音符，斷斷續續地朝我飄來，許久我才辨認出，她唱的是......”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛拉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......唱的是......呃......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“‘請像忘記初春的雪一樣忘記我。’”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......抱歉，我下意識就接話了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛拉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，謝謝你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "閉眼休息一下吧。或許你是今天看書太久了，眼睛累了，所以有些看不清字。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛拉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "醫生，你也看過這本書嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，不過它改編的電影更有名，我反復看了許多次......聽到熟悉的台詞，不自覺就說出口了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛拉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那電影裡的主人公長什麼樣？我覺得她應該是一個紅頭髮、瘦高瘦高的女孩，說話的時候會這樣做鬼臉——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛拉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——嗚！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "請、請不要亂動......臉上的傷口雖然不深，但也需要時間癒合。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛拉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘿嘿。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......電影選擇的演員，和你對主人公的想像似乎不太一樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不過，電影和書講的本來也不是完全相同的故事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果是我的話，可能會更喜歡帶著自己的想像把書看完，然後再去看電影如何演繹吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛拉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好呀，那我也不要你劇透了。等看完這本書，我要自己去看電影。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛拉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，不過我現在是感染者了......感染者就不能進電影院了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛拉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "以前都是媽媽帶我去的，兩個人可以買一份超大份的爆米花。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛拉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她還教我看電影的過程中不許說話。我已經學會了，有看不懂的地方要等到電影結束再問。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛拉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我明明是個乖孩子呀......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛拉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗚......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......請不要太難過。至少，在羅德島艦上的多媒體室，也是可以看電影的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "雖然沒有電影院那麼大的銀幕，但如果是獨自欣賞，或者幾個人一起看電影的話，或許氣氛恰好合適。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就算只是沉浸在電影的聲音裡......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛拉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那等我可以下床活動的時候，醫生你要第一時間帶我去哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸，我嗎？但是我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_ri_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_400_weedy",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你打算離開羅德島了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，我已經在羅德島停留很長時間了，不知不覺地，和這裡的人也熟悉了起來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......熟悉到讓我開始害怕了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不、不是說害怕你的意思。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_400_weedy",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，我明白的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_400_weedy",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你計畫好什麼時候走了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "最近接收了新的患者，我想等最緊急的狀況過去，那之後就離開。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_400_weedy",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那，需要我幫你保密嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，拜託了。我不想說出這些......讓人傷心的事情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_infirmary"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......抱歉，也許我到時候會很忙，所以現在我沒辦法向你做出承諾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛拉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒關係，那我到時候就去拜託其他醫生啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "藥已經換好了。還有什麼異樣感嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛拉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒有啦，謝謝你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛拉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，稍等，可以麻煩醫生調節一下放書的支架嗎？書上的字我有些看不清。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛拉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "礦石病好像把我變成近視了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，這其實並不是近視......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，但你的視力確實會受影響，具體受影響程度......我們現在也不能確定。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "請多看看書，也多看看窗外漂亮的風景吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_corridor"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_400_weedy",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以，那個孩子面臨著失明卻不自知，希望再看一場電影？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，我沒有辦法回答她......無論是真相還是謊言，都太殘忍了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_400_weedy",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是，你是想實現她的願望的，對吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果可能的話，我當然很樂意陪她。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而且，要是能收藏一張電影票根的話，那就更好了。畢竟，這會是我在羅德島看的最後一場電影吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只是，她很可能看不到了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_400_weedy",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "之前羅德島辦的那些相對正式的電影放映會，從場地佈置和技術需求來說，倒是非常簡單。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是覺得......我應該答應那個孩子嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_400_weedy",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這件事當然是由作為醫生的你來決定。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_400_weedy",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我只是認為，即使不是為了別人，只是作為你自己離開羅德島前的紀念，你也可以舉辦一次放映會，然後留下電影票根。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只是為了我自己的事情......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是，恐怕我也不知道該找誰幫忙佈置一個臨時影院。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_400_weedy",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別擔心，這些我應該能幫你做到。雖然跟我的部門不相關，但這只是個簡單的小工程。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_400_weedy",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果你只是需要憑電影票入場......對，也許再加上能自助買票檢票，不需要工作人員值守的話，對你來說更舒適一些。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "謝謝......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_400_weedy",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒事，這對我來說算不了什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_400_weedy",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "希望你能留下一段美好的回憶。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_infirmary"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_045",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "醫生好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_045",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是......那個會給我講電影的醫生嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_045",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "抱歉，我不太看得清，只能透過腳步聲辨認......如果我認錯了的話，對不起。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......沒有，你沒認錯。你好，洛拉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_045",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，那就好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_045",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "醫生，我該叫你什麼名字呀？許多醫生都戴著名牌，但是你沒有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，請不要在意我的名字......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我要做新一輪的身體檢查了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_045",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_045",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "醫生，我其實有點害怕......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_045",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我的視力越來越差，可是大家都不告訴我這是怎麼了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_045",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我知道礦石病是治不好的，但是，我還沒做好準備......我是不是要......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "請不要太過擔心。暫時來說，你是不會有生命危險的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在你身上，礦石病的病情已經逐漸穩定下來了，腹部和腿部的創傷也癒合得很好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這次檢查結果出來之後，醫生們就可以確定什麼時候給傷口拆線。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "很快......也許再過兩天，你就可以去看電影了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_045",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真的嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......對了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "正好，最近羅德島會放映一場電影，就是你在看的這本書所改編的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等你可以自由活動的時候，我們一起去看吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_045",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哇！說好了哦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，說好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_045",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那......檢查的時候可以繼續給我講這個故事嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_045",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我也想自己看書，但是我現在看書有點吃力......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我明白的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "請閉上眼睛，稍微休息一下吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我記得，昨天我們在說主角和來自過去的吟遊詩人，抵達了萊塔尼亞的一座移動城市。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛拉",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "吟遊詩人從來沒有進入過移動城市，只是乘坐入口的升降梯，她就被嚇壞了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛拉",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對於吟遊詩人來說，城市應該很吵吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，非常吵。她靠自己靈敏的耳朵分辨音律，而這雙靈敏的耳朵，在城市裡捕捉到的都是噪音。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她也從沒有見過那些機械校準的、鑲嵌著施術單元的樂器，它們演奏出的樂聲本身就像是一種源石技藝，讓她流連忘返。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而且，這座城市對她很親熱，許多高塔的主人邀請她成為自己的賓客。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛拉",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是她是來自過去的人呀，她還要想辦法回去呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......她其實沒有可以回去的地方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛拉",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "為什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛拉",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——啊，要不就留個懸念吧！等看電影的時候，讓我親眼看到結局是什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......對了，洛拉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛拉",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......看電影的時候，除了看畫面，其實還可以聽到很多聲音。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "吟遊詩人撥動琴弦低聲吟唱，羽獸在高空鳴叫，長風穿過他們漫遊的林海，雨簌簌落在林間小屋的簷瓦上......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果是借用多媒體室放映電影，也可以小聲講話。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "到時候，要是你有......看不清的地方，我還是會講給你聽的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_ri_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蜜莓",
      "speakerId": "avg_449_glider_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "絮雨小姐，要休息一下，來一塊莓果乾嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "謝謝......但、但是不必了，看完洛拉的檢查結果之後，我還要去照顧別的病人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蜜莓",
      "speakerId": "avg_449_glider_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要注意適時放鬆哦，你自己的身體也不太好，不要只照顧別人呀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "謝謝，請不必太擔心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蜜莓",
      "speakerId": "avg_449_glider_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對了，你之前說帶洛拉去看電影，是說周六的那場放映會嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蜜莓",
      "speakerId": "avg_449_glider_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，那你有告訴她最壞的預測嗎？有可能她到時已經什麼都看不到了，只能靠聽覺。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我......還沒有。這些天以來，去看一場電影就是她最大的期盼，我不想讓她太早失望。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蜜莓",
      "speakerId": "avg_449_glider_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，無論如何，要是能讓她重新體驗事故發生之前的日常小事，她的精神壓力也會有些許緩解吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蜜莓",
      "speakerId": "avg_449_glider_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等她身體狀況穩定下來之後，我就帶著零食去找她聊聊天。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蜜莓",
      "speakerId": "avg_449_glider_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "當然啦，我也會給你帶的，下次一定要吃哦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "下次嗎？......嗯，謝謝你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蜜莓",
      "speakerId": "avg_449_glider_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對了，只要是最近來談話室的幹員們，我都推薦去參加周末的放映會好啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蜜莓",
      "speakerId": "avg_449_glider_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "人多一點的話，感覺會更像電影院吧？也能讓患者重新建立與人群接觸的信心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......謝謝。我會記住羅德島的這一切......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——稍等，蜜莓醫生。請來看這個。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_black"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "走吧走吧，放映會要開始啦！\n是誰組織的？\n嗯......不知道，也看不出來。我是被蜜莓推薦來的。\n這裡既沒有宣傳單也沒有告示，好像就是一夜之間在多媒體室搭起來了一個迷你電影院。\n也沒有人在門口檢票，都是自助列印電影票。\n不過，既然我們能列印出電影票，那意思應該就是我們可以進吧？沒有說不讓看吧？\n哎，這部電影我好奇很久了，自從之前看到絮雨的影評，我就一直想找機會欣賞一下。\n嗯，我也是！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "洛拉，請小心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_045",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒事的，醫生，雖然有點黑，但這麼高的台階我怎麼會看不清呢！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_045",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咦，這裡真的好像電影院呀，還有不少人......我可以進去嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "請不要擔心，你和其他人的日常接觸，是不會讓他們感染礦石病的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_045",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那我就坐在第一排啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_045",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這麼大的螢幕......我自己就可以看清欸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_045",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "醫生，你有事要忙的話，就不用陪我啦，等會我能自己找到回病房的路。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，請讓我留在這裡，再看一遍這個故事吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_ri_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——稍等，蜜莓醫生。請來看這個。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "從這幾張造影檢測結果對比來看，源石在洛拉體內的擴散......控制住了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蜜莓",
      "speakerId": "avg_449_glider_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哇......真的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蜜莓",
      "speakerId": "avg_449_glider_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這樣，你們可以好好地一起看電影啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蜜莓",
      "speakerId": "avg_449_glider_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你還有什麼擔憂的事情嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蜜莓",
      "speakerId": "avg_449_glider_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有什麼心事的話，或許可以告訴我哦。無論是高興還是難過的事，把它說出來都會讓人感覺更好一些。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蜜莓",
      "speakerId": "avg_449_glider_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不用擔心，我可是有資格認證的心理輔導者，你不會給我增加負擔的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蜜莓",
      "speakerId": "avg_449_glider_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而且，不說出來的話，你也不知道其他人會作何反應呀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_corridor"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_045",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這部電影......我總覺得還沒有看懂結局，但是心裡又有模模糊糊的想法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_045",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，醫生，你在哭嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "請不要在意......只是每一次聽到結束的音樂，都會觸動許多思緒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這個結局，人們向來有各自不同的理解。甚至我自己在不同的心境下去看，也會產生不一樣的想法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_045",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那就等我長大一些之後，再來重看這部電影吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_045",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "謝謝你呀，醫生，陪了我這麼長時間。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "請稍等一下，洛拉......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "抱歉，我有很重要的事情，還沒有告訴你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_045",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就如你感覺到的一樣，你的視力受到了礦石病的影響，在逐漸下降。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "雖然現在病情暫時抑制住了，但源石對人體的侵蝕......終究是不可逆的過程。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_045",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "意思是，我會變得什麼都看不見嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......是的。我不能判斷失明會在什麼時間出現，但它離你並不遠。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_045",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_045",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "其實，我之前就差不多猜到啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對不起，我一直沒有告訴你......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_045",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒事的呀，醫生，我已經好好想過了，甚至做好了看不到電影的準備。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_045",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以這些天來，我一直都努力睜大眼睛，記住自己看見的街道和房子，看見的花花草草。記住天是藍色的，雪是白色的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_045",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不知道礦石病什麼時候又會讓我的身體痛起來......不知道我哪一天睜眼就會變得什麼也看不見。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_045",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是在那之前，我還想努力把我遇到的一切刻進自己的腦海裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_045",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......還想記住我喜歡的人，照顧我的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_045",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這樣以後聽到那些名字，我還能想起他們的樣子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_045",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就算事情真的像我聽說的那樣，所有東西都會慢慢被忘記，就像上了年紀的爺爺變得不知道我是誰。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_045",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就算總有一天......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就算總有一天我聽到一部電影的名字，再也想不起來它對我來說意味著什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就像電影的結局裡，走進雨幕消失的吟遊詩人......她也曾經在這個時代的雨中起舞過。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，抱歉，我又自顧自接話了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_045",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是你說的就是我心裡的感覺呀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_045",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對啦，你覺得那個結局，吟遊詩人最後是回去了嗎？還是留在了我們身邊呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "現在的話，我覺得......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，是經常出現在多媒體室的那位......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅賓",
      "speakerId": "char_451_robin",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（點頭）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（點頭）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅賓",
      "speakerId": "char_451_robin",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......下周六，我打算借多媒體室放映《記憶漂流》。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅賓",
      "speakerId": "char_451_robin",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你來看嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "下周六嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "絮雨",
      "speakerId": "char_436_whispr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......嗯，我會來的。謝謝你的邀請。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
